(3606922, 503498, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is technically well executed.  Perhaps a little more DOF would have made the stem a little sharper, but that''s not too important.  The reflection of the flag on the table is interesting and might have added more dramatic flair to this if it was stronger.</td>', 'This is technically well executed.  Perhaps a little more DOF would have made the stem a little sharper, but that''s not too important.  The reflection of the flag on the table is interesting and might have added more dramatic flair to this if it was stronger.', '2007-05-02 18:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606943, 505787, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, almost as if the model were contemplating the meaning of pi.  The lighting seems a little off, it is a little too bright on her right arm and chest, and the shadow from her elbow is a little distracting.  The color also seems a little off.  Finally, the negative space on the left of the image doesn''t seem to contribute much for me.  I feel like there is a story trying to be told here, but I''m not sure I get it.</td>', 'This is interesting, almost as if the model were contemplating the meaning of pi.  The lighting seems a little off, it is a little too bright on her right arm and chest, and the shadow from her elbow is a little distracting.  The color also seems a little off.  Finally, the negative space on the left of the image doesn''t seem to contribute much for me.  I feel like there is a story trying to be told here, but I''m not sure I get it.', '2007-05-02 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606964, 506090, 30508, '<td valign="top">Clever and well executed.  I like that it is a different approach to the challenge, but it doesn''t really grab me either.  Still, it''s good for a laugh.</td>', 'Clever and well executed.  I like that it is a different approach to the challenge, but it doesn''t really grab me either.  Still, it''s good for a laugh.', '2007-05-02 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606973, 504860, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and lit.  I wish the pi looked more like chocolate, like a brownie perhaps.  But still very well done.</td>', 'Nicely composed and lit.  I wish the pi looked more like chocolate, like a brownie perhaps.  But still very well done.', '2007-05-02 18:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606974, 505836, 42256, '<td valign="top">nice idea .. i wish the seconds hand was at 0.15 .. but well who wants the exact value of pi :) 7</td>', 'nice idea .. i wish the seconds hand was at 0.15 .. but well who wants the exact value of pi :) 7', '2007-05-02 18:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606979, 505216, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an engaging photo because of the lighting and the grain in the wood.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is an engaging photo because of the lighting and the grain in the wood.  Nicely done.', '2007-05-02 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606988, 503606, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the colour cast. Good use of exposure to get a vignette. Why is the book upside down?</td>', 'I like the colour cast. Good use of exposure to get a vignette. Why is the book upside down?', '2007-05-02 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606990, 505342, 57032, '<td valign="top">Clever. The paper is too exposed.</td>', 'Clever. The paper is too exposed.', '2007-05-02 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606994, 503486, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the front and good depth of field. Nice colours.</td>', 'Nice detail in the front and good depth of field. Nice colours.', '2007-05-02 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606995, 503498, 42256, '<td valign="top">nice idea .. imo background is distracting ! 7</td>', 'nice idea .. imo background is distracting ! 7', '2007-05-02 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3606996, 505327, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea, but it would be better if the lighting wasn''t quite so flat.  Also, I think it would be better without the pi label.  It would make the viewer stop and examine the photo more without it so blatantly in our face.</td>', 'This is a clever idea, but it would be better if the lighting wasn''t quite so flat.  Also, I think it would be better without the pi label.  It would make the viewer stop and examine the photo more without it so blatantly in our face.', '2007-05-02 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607003, 504259, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good focus. The white ring around his left eye (our right) is distracting.</td>', 'Good focus. The white ring around his left eye (our right) is distracting.', '2007-05-02 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607006, 505992, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I really like the composition, only distraction is the plug-point in the bottom, but I am just being picky! 9</td>', 'Great shot, I really like the composition, only distraction is the plug-point in the bottom, but I am just being picky! 9', '2007-05-02 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607010, 506042, 30508, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach.  I like the black and white treatment of it, but the grey cereal feels a little off.  Also, I think it would be stronger if the lighting directed the eye to the pi symbol.</td>', 'An interesting approach.  I like the black and white treatment of it, but the grey cereal feels a little off.  Also, I think it would be stronger if the lighting directed the eye to the pi symbol.', '2007-05-02 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607011, 505791, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good shadow and nice contrast.</td>', 'Good shadow and nice contrast.', '2007-05-02 18:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607019, 505499, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but the lighting isn''t strong enough.  It feels far too dark.  I do like the subtle way the pi symbols are found in different areas of the water though.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but the lighting isn''t strong enough.  It feels far too dark.  I do like the subtle way the pi symbols are found in different areas of the water though.', '2007-05-02 18:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607022, 504921, 57032, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge. A bit of a distracting scene, and the immediate foreground is out of focus (which distracts me).</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge. A bit of a distracting scene, and the immediate foreground is out of focus (which distracts me).', '2007-05-02 18:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607034, 505906, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, but I would suggest a shallower depth of field (and perhaps a different perspective) to help those five cards stand out more. The odd lighting on the 5 of clubs is distracting, and the numbers on many of the cards are jagged or out of focus.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge, but I would suggest a shallower depth of field (and perhaps a different perspective) to help those five cards stand out more. The odd lighting on the 5 of clubs is distracting, and the numbers on many of the cards are jagged or out of focus.', '2007-05-02 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607038, 503032, 30508, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I don''t really have a lot to say about it.  It is technically very good, but I don''t find it very inspiring.  Bonus points for thinking outside of the box, though.</td>', 'Clever.  I don''t really have a lot to say about it.  It is technically very good, but I don''t find it very inspiring.  Bonus points for thinking outside of the box, though.', '2007-05-02 18:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
