(3609593, 505782, 36689, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, nice concept but the background is over bright according to me. Overall good, 7 :)</td>', 'Lovely photo, nice concept but the background is over bright according to me. Overall good, 7 :)', '2007-05-03 08:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609605, 505875, 36689, '<td valign="top">The title is real funny :)</td>', 'The title is real funny :)', '2007-05-03 08:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609739, 506184, 75731, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t really make sense to me. I can just about accept it up as far as 3.14 but to do that Ineed to foolow on with 49144 and then it gets more confusing. I just don''t think it works, especially as Pi is a Greek letter.</td>', 'It doesn''t really make sense to me. I can just about accept it up as far as 3.14 but to do that Ineed to foolow on with 49144 and then it gets more confusing. I just don''t think it works, especially as Pi is a Greek letter.', '2007-05-03 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609781, 503032, 75731, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like this. It just isn''t photographic in appearance and even ignoring that it doesn''t appeal to me aesthetically. The concept is fine and honestly I''ve seen worse expressions of the 22/7 idea but my first reaction was that you''ve completely constructed this on your computer. I''m pressuming that this is actually based on a photo and that the adjustments are done by heavy use of levels in Photoshop, to be honest I think you would have had something if you went for a more natural appearance.</td>', 'I really don''t like this. It just isn''t photographic in appearance and even ignoring that it doesn''t appeal to me aesthetically. The concept is fine and honestly I''ve seen worse expressions of the 22/7 idea but my first reaction was that you''ve completely constructed this on your computer. I''m pressuming that this is actually based on a photo and that the adjustments are done by heavy use of levels in Photoshop, to be honest I think you would have had something if you went for a more natural appearance.', '2007-05-03 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609790, 502912, 75731, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little under exposed, the dof is a little shallow and the focus is on the wrong part of the image. Compositionally the out of focus 8 is dominating the 3.14. For me the image just doens''t work. If it were a little brighter and you managed to compose the image with the 3.14 as the focal point, it would have been quite successful.</td>', 'I think it''s a little under exposed, the dof is a little shallow and the focus is on the wrong part of the image. Compositionally the out of focus 8 is dominating the 3.14. For me the image just doens''t work. If it were a little brighter and you managed to compose the image with the 3.14 as the focal point, it would have been quite successful.', '2007-05-03 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609791, 505906, 75731, '<td valign="top">I like it, very creative idea, maybe the contrast is a little high?</td>', 'I like it, very creative idea, maybe the contrast is a little high?', '2007-05-03 09:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609792, 506183, 75731, '<td valign="top">I like it, the best pi/pie pun I''ve seen in the contest. I also like the overall composition. My only criticism is that something feels off, like something isn''t level or balanced, but that could just be my imagination</td>', 'I like it, the best pi/pie pun I''ve seen in the contest. I also like the overall composition. My only criticism is that something feels off, like something isn''t level or balanced, but that could just be my imagination', '2007-05-03 09:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609796, 505670, 75731, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you were going for but I think your dof is too shallow, I can''t really make out what else is on the paper (other than one big Pi), maybe if the focus had been the other way round? With the hand blurred and the paper sharp this would have been better?</td>', 'I think I know what you were going for but I think your dof is too shallow, I can''t really make out what else is on the paper (other than one big Pi), maybe if the focus had been the other way round? With the hand blurred and the paper sharp this would have been better?', '2007-05-03 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3609798, 505354, 75731, '<td valign="top">Ok, I get it, nice idea. I think the shot is just too chaotic to work. But then maybe the chaos is fitting for a transendental mathematical constant.</td>', 'Ok, I get it, nice idea. I think the shot is just too chaotic to work. But then maybe the chaos is fitting for a transendental mathematical constant.', '2007-05-03 09:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
