(3610564, 503486, 75323, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and sweet shot... But In my opinion it''s just a bit too far from the PI idea. I may increase my skill at binary.</td>', 'Clever idea and sweet shot... But In my opinion it''s just a bit too far from the PI idea. I may increase my skill at binary.', '2007-05-03 13:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610570, 504860, 49321, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious!</td>', 'Looks delicious!', '2007-05-03 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610571, 503606, 49321, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and composition. Very nice.</td>', 'Love the lighting and composition. Very nice.', '2007-05-03 13:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610574, 506141, 75323, '<td valign="top">Strong idea and very well done. The title perfectly fits, too. One of my challenge''s favourites.</td>', 'Strong idea and very well done. The title perfectly fits, too. One of my challenge''s favourites.', '2007-05-03 13:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610577, 506197, 75323, '<td valign="top">I just wonder... Is this really meant to be a giant Pi ?</td>', 'I just wonder... Is this really meant to be a giant Pi ?', '2007-05-03 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610579, 503522, 49321, '<td valign="top">...well. It''s 2.1416 if you round it. It''s actually 3.14159... It really confused me at first.</td>', '...well. It''s 2.1416 if you round it. It''s actually 3.14159... It really confused me at first.', '2007-05-03 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610580, 506195, 75323, '<td valign="top">The idea could''ve been nice, but the lighting and the background don''t help the shot.</td>', 'The idea could''ve been nice, but the lighting and the background don''t help the shot.', '2007-05-03 13:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610581, 505499, 49321, '<td valign="top">Great quick shot.</td>', 'Great quick shot.', '2007-05-03 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610585, 503580, 75323, '<td valign="top">If I can just have ONE criticism about it: I''d have liked to see the very beggining of the number, just to understand better what this is about. Anyway, that''s of course a good shot.</td>', 'If I can just have ONE criticism about it: I''d have liked to see the very beggining of the number, just to understand better what this is about. Anyway, that''s of course a good shot.', '2007-05-03 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610587, 506129, 49321, '<td valign="top">Nice use of speed and light.</td>', 'Nice use of speed and light.', '2007-05-03 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610593, 504597, 75323, '<td valign="top">Haha, I love the idea ! And the composition works quiet well.</td>', 'Haha, I love the idea ! And the composition works quiet well.', '2007-05-03 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610601, 505039, 75323, '<td valign="top">Wow, simple but working. What is this ? (makes me think of a parfum ad)</td>', 'Wow, simple but working. What is this ? (makes me think of a parfum ad)', '2007-05-03 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610608, 506184, 75323, '<td valign="top">God... I didn''t even think that it was possible to write it that way.<br/>Nice classical shot.</td>', 'God... I didn''t even think that it was possible to write it that way.Nice classical shot.', '2007-05-03 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610610, 505393, 49321, '<td valign="top">Haha, witty and great lighting.</td>', 'Haha, witty and great lighting.', '2007-05-03 13:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610631, 505872, 75323, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the meaning, but the lighting could''ve turn the shot better, I think so.</td>', 'I like the composition and the meaning, but the lighting could''ve turn the shot better, I think so.', '2007-05-03 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610762, 505963, 42713, '<td valign="top">Cute ;)</td>', 'Cute ;)', '2007-05-03 14:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610806, 503981, 70514, '<td valign="top">Super cute idea.</td>', 'Super cute idea.', '2007-05-03 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610812, 506069, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''d love to know how you did this (I think I have an idea).  The starkness but detail of it really adds to the feeling of pi, imo.  Nicely done, executed, and thought out.</td>', 'Wow.  I''d love to know how you did this (I think I have an idea).  The starkness but detail of it really adds to the feeling of pi, imo.  Nicely done, executed, and thought out.', '2007-05-03 14:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610836, 503223, 77661, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, i don''t really know what that is that we''re looking through though. Almost looks like a border, wish there was a little detail there.</td>', 'Cool shot, i don''t really know what that is that we''re looking through though. Almost looks like a border, wish there was a little detail there.', '2007-05-03 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610838, 506093, 70514, '<td valign="top">Now if the top Woody could''ve held that pose but laying on his "belly", it''d look like a crazy "caterpillar" break dance slow motion move from the ''80''s!  I like this, it''s funny.</td>', 'Now if the top Woody could''ve held that pose but laying on his "belly", it''d look like a crazy "caterpillar" break dance slow motion move from the ''80''s!  I like this, it''s funny.', '2007-05-03 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610844, 505782, 77661, '<td valign="top">Seems overexposed to me, but i still like it. The water just blends in with the sky, which is interesting.</td>', 'Seems overexposed to me, but i still like it. The water just blends in with the sky, which is interesting.', '2007-05-03 14:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610852, 504054, 77661, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure i''m thinking way too much on this one, but did you write the numbers bigger twards the end? Very cool if so.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure i''m thinking way too much on this one, but did you write the numbers bigger twards the end? Very cool if so.', '2007-05-03 14:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610857, 503964, 77661, '<td valign="top">Looks good</td>', 'Looks good', '2007-05-03 14:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610861, 505856, 77661, '<td valign="top">It made me laugh, nice........</td>', 'It made me laugh, nice........', '2007-05-03 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610862, 504464, 77661, '<td valign="top">Right on......</td>', 'Right on......', '2007-05-03 14:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610866, 505488, 77661, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I dig it.</td>', 'Very cool, I dig it.', '2007-05-03 14:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610871, 506028, 77661, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, my eye is lost in it, BUT Its cool nevertheless.</td>', 'I don''t get it, my eye is lost in it, BUT Its cool nevertheless.', '2007-05-03 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610874, 506141, 77661, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2007-05-03 14:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610877, 506140, 77661, '<td valign="top">I thought there was going to be alot more shots like this one.</td>', 'I thought there was going to be alot more shots like this one.', '2007-05-03 14:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610879, 504953, 77661, '<td valign="top">Forces your eye to a black hole of nothingness! Awesome</td>', 'Forces your eye to a black hole of nothingness! Awesome', '2007-05-03 14:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610882, 505918, 77661, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is, looks interesting</td>', 'Don''t know what it is, looks interesting', '2007-05-03 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610883, 506183, 77661, '<td valign="top">veru humorous</td>', 'veru humorous', '2007-05-03 14:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610886, 506090, 77661, '<td valign="top">hahahha</td>', 'hahahha', '2007-05-03 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610894, 502912, 77661, '<td valign="top">Wish the desk and chair in the background were softer, and maybe a little more dramatic lighting</td>', 'Wish the desk and chair in the background were softer, and maybe a little more dramatic lighting', '2007-05-03 14:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610897, 503498, 77661, '<td valign="top">Apple pi war hero! wheres his gun?</td>', 'Apple pi war hero! wheres his gun?', '2007-05-03 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610899, 504419, 77661, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2007-05-03 15:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610902, 505499, 77661, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did it, but if thats in camera thats awesome...... wish it wasn''t quite as dark though</td>', 'I don''t know how you did it, but if thats in camera thats awesome...... wish it wasn''t quite as dark though', '2007-05-03 15:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3610906, 506129, 77661, '<td valign="top">Love it, awesome Job! the only thing, i wish the 3.14 was more pronounced, maybe in the center with the rest of the numbers around it.</td>', 'Love it, awesome Job! the only thing, i wish the 3.14 was more pronounced, maybe in the center with the rest of the numbers around it.', '2007-05-03 15:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611026, 504860, 16230, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon... I think. :D</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon... I think. :D', '2007-05-03 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611038, 505393, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2007-05-03 15:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611047, 505488, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed.  I don''t know if it would have been possible to get the magnifying glass more in focus as well, but that might have made this even stronger.</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed.  I don''t know if it would have been possible to get the magnifying glass more in focus as well, but that might have made this even stronger.', '2007-05-03 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611054, 505872, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I especially like the drawing of the house.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I especially like the drawing of the house.', '2007-05-03 15:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611060, 506093, 30508, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the background is the most interesting part of this to me.  I would love to see this with the shadow more emphasized in both composition and contrast.</td>', 'The shadow in the background is the most interesting part of this to me.  I would love to see this with the shadow more emphasized in both composition and contrast.', '2007-05-03 15:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611071, 505918, 16230, '<td valign="top">A vibrantly colorful abstract. Well done!</td>', 'A vibrantly colorful abstract. Well done!', '2007-05-03 15:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611074, 506107, 30508, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  I''ll be interested to see how you achieved the effect.  From a technical standpoint, the skin color seems a little bit off.  Also, if the pi shape wasn''t quite so sharp, it wouldn''t look as cut out and might look more natural.</td>', 'Creative idea.  I''ll be interested to see how you achieved the effect.  From a technical standpoint, the skin color seems a little bit off.  Also, if the pi shape wasn''t quite so sharp, it wouldn''t look as cut out and might look more natural.', '2007-05-03 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611079, 504351, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, colors, and composition.  It speaks to me as if it is saying "hey, look, pi can be found anywhere we look".  But maybe that''s just going overboard :)</td>', 'Nice perspective, colors, and composition.  It speaks to me as if it is saying "hey, look, pi can be found anywhere we look".  But maybe that''s just going overboard :)', '2007-05-03 15:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611087, 505342, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and nice composition.  I''m curious, was the pencil printed onto the background?  It seems a little less thre-dimensional than the watch.  But that''s ok in order to get the fade off effect.</td>', 'Interesting idea and nice composition.  I''m curious, was the pencil printed onto the background?  It seems a little less thre-dimensional than the watch.  But that''s ok in order to get the fade off effect.', '2007-05-03 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611094, 505464, 30508, '<td valign="top">This feels a little contrived to me and the toothpicks don''t stand out all that well against the wood background.</td>', 'This feels a little contrived to me and the toothpicks don''t stand out all that well against the wood background.', '2007-05-03 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611096, 505589, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea and I like the composition, but the haloing doesn''t help at all.</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea and I like the composition, but the haloing doesn''t help at all.', '2007-05-03 15:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611097, 505953, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  The subtlety of the image is mirrored in the graceful circumference of the arc.  The out-of-focus compass begs the eye for more clarity, which is a perfect statement for this challenge.  Great work!</td>', 'This is lovely.  The subtlety of the image is mirrored in the graceful circumference of the arc.  The out-of-focus compass begs the eye for more clarity, which is a perfect statement for this challenge.  Great work!', '2007-05-03 15:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611113, 505589, 66353, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge - and a nice picture too. 8...</td>', 'Great take on the challenge - and a nice picture too. 8...', '2007-05-03 15:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611124, 503498, 59478, '<td valign="top">play on words, love it!  pretty good photo too</td>', 'play on words, love it!  pretty good photo too', '2007-05-03 16:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611125, 506042, 64853, '<td valign="top">i like this. very cool idea.</td>', 'i like this. very cool idea.', '2007-05-03 16:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611129, 505500, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the colors and the way the bokeh echos the water drop.  The drop itself looks like a minature earth,m and the strands form interesting geometric shapes that tie everything back to mathematics.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the colors and the way the bokeh echos the water drop.  The drop itself looks like a minature earth,m and the strands form interesting geometric shapes that tie everything back to mathematics.', '2007-05-03 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611134, 506109, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, but because the trail leads out of the frame, it feels like it stops, whereas if it went on to the horizon and the horizon was visible in the frame, that would give a stronger sense of the infinity that you are going for.  From a technical standpoint, the shadow across of the middle of the image takes a lot away from it.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, but because the trail leads out of the frame, it feels like it stops, whereas if it went on to the horizon and the horizon was visible in the frame, that would give a stronger sense of the infinity that you are going for.  From a technical standpoint, the shadow across of the middle of the image takes a lot away from it.', '2007-05-03 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611136, 505992, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition and very well lit.  I like it a lot.  My only nit pick (which I''m sure others have pointed out, so forgive me) is the outlet box at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'This is a very nice composition and very well lit.  I like it a lot.  My only nit pick (which I''m sure others have pointed out, so forgive me) is the outlet box at the bottom of the frame.', '2007-05-03 16:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611137, 504731, 59478, '<td valign="top">this photo has an Asian feel to it.  I like it!</td>', 'this photo has an Asian feel to it.  I like it!', '2007-05-03 16:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611141, 506005, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea.  The lighting seems a bit off, but I can''t put my finger on why.  Perhaps its just the highlights on the folds in the plastic.  The focus also seems a bit soft, but that''s not necessarily a bad thing given the fuzzy nature of pi ;)</td>', 'This is a cool idea.  The lighting seems a bit off, but I can''t put my finger on why.  Perhaps its just the highlights on the folds in the plastic.  The focus also seems a bit soft, but that''s not necessarily a bad thing given the fuzzy nature of pi ;)', '2007-05-03 16:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611144, 506195, 64853, '<td valign="top">clever idea.</td>', 'clever idea.', '2007-05-03 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611146, 504465, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely landscape and evokes thoughts of the infinity that pi represents.</td>', 'This is a lovely landscape and evokes thoughts of the infinity that pi represents.', '2007-05-03 16:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611152, 504465, 64853, '<td valign="top">good shot, but it doesn''t fit the challenge</td>', 'good shot, but it doesn''t fit the challenge', '2007-05-03 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611161, 506030, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a clever interpretation of the challenge and very reminiscent of the closing sequence of the movie.  The problem I always have with color negative images is that they highlight every weird nuance of texture and I find that it detracts from the overall quality of the image.  Still, this is very creative and well executed.</td>', 'This is a clever interpretation of the challenge and very reminiscent of the closing sequence of the movie.  The problem I always have with color negative images is that they highlight every weird nuance of texture and I find that it detracts from the overall quality of the image.  Still, this is very creative and well executed.', '2007-05-03 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611182, 506093, 52713, '<td valign="top">clever, even for woodies! ;-)</td>', 'clever, even for woodies! ;-)', '2007-05-03 16:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611186, 504464, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and geometric composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and geometric composition.', '2007-05-03 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611189, 505342, 52713, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2007-05-03 16:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611191, 506090, 77750, '<td valign="top">cool idea, but the execution had much more potential.</td>', 'cool idea, but the execution had much more potential.', '2007-05-03 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611192, 505499, 52713, '<td valign="top">Ok, at first glance I didn''t see the Pi symbl inthe water drops.</td>', 'Ok, at first glance I didn''t see the Pi symbl inthe water drops.', '2007-05-03 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611195, 506069, 77750, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t seem like basic editing. nevertheless a very nice one</td>', 'this doesn''t seem like basic editing. nevertheless a very nice one', '2007-05-03 16:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611198, 506195, 56502, '<td valign="top">Playful idea.</td>', 'Playful idea.', '2007-05-03 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611207, 503223, 56502, '<td valign="top">In this case the border really adds to the picture. Cool!</td>', 'In this case the border really adds to the picture. Cool!', '2007-05-03 16:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611260, 502811, 77196, '<td valign="top">Use of a round frame at the edge of the pot would enhance this a lot. Nice use of green / red / white</td>', 'Use of a round frame at the edge of the pot would enhance this a lot. Nice use of green / red / white', '2007-05-03 16:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611288, 506134, 77196, '<td valign="top">Creative. Nice framing/crop. Picky, but phone pole / wires in background are distracting, and the Chevy symbols not parallel bother my sense of order. Would this be 2 pi?</td>', 'Creative. Nice framing/crop. Picky, but phone pole / wires in background are distracting, and the Chevy symbols not parallel bother my sense of order. Would this be 2 pi?', '2007-05-03 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611299, 504953, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the fractal nature of this.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the fractal nature of this.', '2007-05-03 16:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611303, 505814, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your comments make this photo. Top part is a bit too washed out (on purpose?)</td>', 'Your comments make this photo. Top part is a bit too washed out (on purpose?)', '2007-05-03 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611305, 503981, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a real stretch for the challenge, but it shows a sweet moment.</td>', 'This is a real stretch for the challenge, but it shows a sweet moment.', '2007-05-03 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611312, 505856, 30508, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, cherry pie &lt;drool&gt;.  Clever idea.  The lighting isn''t great for showing off the rich colors and textures of the pie, and the crease in the table cloth is a little distracting.</td>', 'Mmmm, cherry pie <drool>.  Clever idea.  The lighting isn''t great for showing off the rich colors and textures of the pie, and the crease in the table cloth is a little distracting.', '2007-05-03 16:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611313, 505670, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too much going on in this photo - needs a stronger central concept. The Pi symbol could be it, but it is out of focus. The top 1/2 is indistinguishable.</td>', 'Too much going on in this photo - needs a stronger central concept. The Pi symbol could be it, but it is out of focus. The top 1/2 is indistinguishable.', '2007-05-03 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611318, 505963, 73414, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2007-05-03 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611319, 504731, 30508, '<td valign="top">A very striking image and nicely composed.  What''s with the flowers, though?  I like them from a compositional standpoint, but I don''t know what they add to the story.</td>', 'A very striking image and nicely composed.  What''s with the flowers, though?  I like them from a compositional standpoint, but I don''t know what they add to the story.', '2007-05-03 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611322, 504419, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. You got me - I love mobius strips. Nice lighting. Not sure what is in the background, but at least it is blurred so it does not compete for main subject.</td>', 'OK. You got me - I love mobius strips. Nice lighting. Not sure what is in the background, but at least it is blurred so it does not compete for main subject.', '2007-05-03 17:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611338, 505953, 73414, '<td valign="top">too blurry.</td>', 'too blurry.', '2007-05-03 17:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611339, 503391, 77196, '<td valign="top">I agree the shot needs something besides the calculator - but an out of focus pencil is not it. Perhaps moving the pencil to a corner of the shot... although it does serve as an undeline to the Pi key. Excellent color, and the yellow of the pencil ties in nicely.</td>', 'I agree the shot needs something besides the calculator - but an out of focus pencil is not it. Perhaps moving the pencil to a corner of the shot... although it does serve as an undeline to the Pi key. Excellent color, and the yellow of the pencil ties in nicely.', '2007-05-03 17:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611343, 505589, 73414, '<td valign="top">no fair!</td>', 'no fair!', '2007-05-03 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611351, 505354, 77196, '<td valign="top">Clever. There are too many main features in one shot. Unfortunately, the building in the background is a major one (the strong window crossbucks, white frames, and tan wall - strong contrasts) - to blur it but not the Pi, ruler or CD would be a real challenge.</td>', 'Clever. There are too many main features in one shot. Unfortunately, the building in the background is a major one (the strong window crossbucks, white frames, and tan wall - strong contrasts) - to blur it but not the Pi, ruler or CD would be a real challenge.', '2007-05-03 17:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611355, 505953, 73929, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I think I would have preferred the pencil to be the focus though.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I think I would have preferred the pencil to be the focus though.', '2007-05-03 17:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611359, 505591, 73414, '<td valign="top">Aww...poor thing! Math=torture! =D</td>', 'Aww...poor thing! Math=torture! =D', '2007-05-03 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611365, 505499, 77196, '<td valign="top">Boy, hope you don''t get counted off because the Pi symbol is too easy to miss (it is clear in the two larger bubbles on the left). This is a great shot, and the subtle Pi symbols tie it in nicely.</td>', 'Boy, hope you don''t get counted off because the Pi symbol is too easy to miss (it is clear in the two larger bubbles on the left). This is a great shot, and the subtle Pi symbols tie it in nicely.', '2007-05-03 17:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611368, 506030, 73414, '<td valign="top">WILEY.</td>', 'WILEY.', '2007-05-03 17:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611375, 506183, 73414, '<td valign="top">HAHA!</td>', 'HAHA!', '2007-05-03 17:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611377, 503981, 73414, '<td valign="top">Okay way to be creative!</td>', 'Okay way to be creative!', '2007-05-03 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3611379, 503981, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Nice lighting, but tough. I''m guessing this is a "shoot what you have" picture. If you could stage it, I''d try to get the ducks out of the shadow and maybe (not sure) lose the floats.</td>', 'Cute. Nice lighting, but tough. I''m guessing this is a "shoot what you have" picture. If you could stage it, I''d try to get the ducks out of the shadow and maybe (not sure) lose the floats.', '2007-05-03 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611388, 504119, 77196, '<td valign="top">The perfect match!</td>', 'The perfect match!', '2007-05-03 17:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611405, 502912, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too much in background that is irrelevant to your message. If you need something in background, use something a little more uniform than black / dark grey, tan (chair) brown (wood) and white (case in upper right and item on right side of left bookcase shelf).</td>', 'Too much in background that is irrelevant to your message. If you need something in background, use something a little more uniform than black / dark grey, tan (chair) brown (wood) and white (case in upper right and item on right side of left bookcase shelf).', '2007-05-03 17:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611494, 505354, 47541, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you chose to use the CD and ruler when you have that great stone "pi symbol" in the background?  To be honest the CD and ruler take away from the image rather than add to it.  Have a go at getting low and shooting the stone sculpture with those flowers out of focus in the foreground - just an idea</td>', 'I wonder why you chose to use the CD and ruler when you have that great stone "pi symbol" in the background?  To be honest the CD and ruler take away from the image rather than add to it.  Have a go at getting low and shooting the stone sculpture with those flowers out of focus in the foreground - just an idea', '2007-05-03 17:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611543, 506134, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and tonal range.  The background is a little distracting.  Overall it doesn''t really speak to me, though.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and tonal range.  The background is a little distracting.  Overall it doesn''t really speak to me, though.', '2007-05-03 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611555, 505836, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  The reflections are little distracting and the image as a whole doesn''t really resonate with me.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  The reflections are little distracting and the image as a whole doesn''t really resonate with me.', '2007-05-03 17:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611559, 504419, 30508, '<td valign="top">Creative idea -- the mobius strip represting the infinty of pi.  I like the idea of the background, but the stripes through the bokeh and general dustyness of the image distract a little from it.  Great concept, though.</td>', 'Creative idea -- the mobius strip represting the infinty of pi.  I like the idea of the background, but the stripes through the bokeh and general dustyness of the image distract a little from it.  Great concept, though.', '2007-05-03 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611567, 506075, 30508, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shapes and forms.  The image lacks tonal range though and feels a little flat.</td>', 'Intriguing shapes and forms.  The image lacks tonal range though and feels a little flat.', '2007-05-03 17:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611574, 505782, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice find.  I like the treatment of this with the pylons fading out into the blown out sky.  Very surreal.</td>', 'Nice find.  I like the treatment of this with the pylons fading out into the blown out sky.  Very surreal.', '2007-05-03 17:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611577, 506140, 30508, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and execution.  It seems to have a slight red cast to it though.</td>', 'Clever idea and execution.  It seems to have a slight red cast to it though.', '2007-05-03 17:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611581, 505109, 30508, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is interesting, but the image lacks much substance beyond that.</td>', 'The lighting on this is interesting, but the image lacks much substance beyond that.', '2007-05-03 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611594, 504597, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting shapes.  A tighter view of this without the surrounding box might be even more compelling.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting shapes.  A tighter view of this without the surrounding box might be even more compelling.', '2007-05-03 17:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611604, 505834, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a thought-provoking, well executed image.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is a thought-provoking, well executed image.  Nice job.', '2007-05-03 17:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611613, 503486, 30508, '<td valign="top">An interesting look at the confluence of mathematics and nature.</td>', 'An interesting look at the confluence of mathematics and nature.', '2007-05-03 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611620, 504119, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice colors for the background.  It really helps to set the match sticks apart.</td>', 'Nice colors for the background.  It really helps to set the match sticks apart.', '2007-05-03 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611632, 505694, 30508, '<td valign="top">Good use of painting with light.  That must have been a little tough to get right.  Still, I feel like it needs something more to really make a statement.  Perhaps more flare like on the ...''s at the end.</td>', 'Good use of painting with light.  That must have been a little tough to get right.  Still, I feel like it needs something more to really make a statement.  Perhaps more flare like on the ...''s at the end.', '2007-05-03 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611637, 506100, 30508, '<td valign="top">Well lit and an interesting duotone treatment.  I like the graphic simplicity of this.</td>', 'Well lit and an interesting duotone treatment.  I like the graphic simplicity of this.', '2007-05-03 18:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611643, 506010, 30508, '<td valign="top">This was a good find, with the pi-shaped support and the strong circular features.  However, I think a more straight-on approach would have better emphasized the graphical nature of these elements.</td>', 'This was a good find, with the pi-shaped support and the strong circular features.  However, I think a more straight-on approach would have better emphasized the graphical nature of these elements.', '2007-05-03 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3611648, 506195, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice color and interesting lighting.  Clever word play, too.</td>', 'Nice color and interesting lighting.  Clever word play, too.', '2007-05-03 18:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
