(3612724, 506030, 76268, '<td valign="top">haha looks similar to this, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=17287" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/84/thumb/17287.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/84/thumb/17287.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/84/thumb/17287.jpg"/></a> which won the blue in the previous Pi challenge... also post proc seems quite harsh.</td>', 'haha looks similar to this,  which won the blue in the previous Pi challenge... also post proc seems quite harsh.', '2007-05-03 23:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612730, 505834, 76268, '<td valign="top">haha brilliant! perfectly captures pi without being explicit.. most other entries just photograph a projection of 3.141... a 10 :)</td>', 'haha brilliant! perfectly captures pi without being explicit.. most other entries just photograph a projection of 3.141... a 10 :)', '2007-05-03 23:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612824, 506069, 31307, '<td valign="top">What a horrible photo.  I hate it and I hate this photographer''s guts.  I''m going to take his projector away and leave it on his bloody beach to rust.  No no.  He might get a good picture out of that.  I''m going to throw his CAMERA on the beach or no, better yet, on the highway in front of an 18 wheeler.  If THAT doesn''t stop him...<br/> <br/>Long story short, I am so not giving you the awesome score you deserve, Zoomdak.</td>', 'What a horrible photo.  I hate it and I hate this photographer''s guts.  I''m going to take his projector away and leave it on his bloody beach to rust.  No no.  He might get a good picture out of that.  I''m going to throw his CAMERA on the beach or no, better yet, on the highway in front of an 18 wheeler.  If THAT doesn''t stop him... Long story short, I am so not giving you the awesome score you deserve, Zoomdak.', '2007-05-03 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612834, 505589, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones and saturation.  Very well executed shot.</td>', 'Nice range of tones and saturation.  Very well executed shot.', '2007-05-03 23:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612844, 505499, 63806, '<td valign="top">Awsome</td>', 'Awsome', '2007-05-03 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3612846, 503498, 31307, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I think the flag in the background is a good touch but would be interested to see more of the blue field as a means to contrast the two colors and add a nice tension to the piece.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I think the flag in the background is a good touch but would be interested to see more of the blue field as a means to contrast the two colors and add a nice tension to the piece.', '2007-05-03 23:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
