(3612889, 505814, 31307, '<td valign="top">The penciling is difficult to read past the frowning face.  Looks like your flash or whatever light source you were using could have benefited from using a soft box or other material to even out the light thrown onto the paper.  The hotspot in the upper left is just washing too much detail out.</td>', 'The penciling is difficult to read past the frowning face.  Looks like your flash or whatever light source you were using could have benefited from using a soft box or other material to even out the light thrown onto the paper.  The hotspot in the upper left is just washing too much detail out.', '2007-05-03 23:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
