(3614058, 505500, 34938, '<td valign="top">beautiful colours, nice bokeh in the lens</td>', 'beautiful colours, nice bokeh in the lens', '2007-05-04 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614064, 504681, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, but there are a few things that don''t work well for me.  First, because the background has a similar tonal value to the hand, it doesn''t stand out as much as it could.  Second, the fingers seem a bit foreshortened possible because they were slightly curled in.  Finally, the composition doesn''t quite work.  You get a nice curve from the thumb through the fingers, but then it ends and the eye is forced to jump to the off-center ring.  If there was some element that extended the curve around and back to the ring in a spiral, it would not only add a stronger visual element but would also be a stronger tie in to the pi theme of the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting image, but there are a few things that don''t work well for me.  First, because the background has a similar tonal value to the hand, it doesn''t stand out as much as it could.  Second, the fingers seem a bit foreshortened possible because they were slightly curled in.  Finally, the composition doesn''t quite work.  You get a nice curve from the thumb through the fingers, but then it ends and the eye is forced to jump to the off-center ring.  If there was some element that extended the curve around and back to the ring in a spiral, it would not only add a stronger visual element but would also be a stronger tie in to the pi theme of the challenge.', '2007-05-04 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614065, 505918, 34938, '<td valign="top">stunning colour and abstract...</td>', 'stunning colour and abstract...', '2007-05-04 09:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614077, 505589, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and it ties into the challenge on many levels.  It feels a bit over-sharpened to me, but that''s such a catch-22 here at dpc.  If you didn''t over-sharpen, I''d probably be saying it feels too soft!  Either way, the lighting is lovely and the colors are nice and rich.  Great job!</td>', 'Nicely captured and it ties into the challenge on many levels.  It feels a bit over-sharpened to me, but that''s such a catch-22 here at dpc.  If you didn''t over-sharpen, I''d probably be saying it feels too soft!  Either way, the lighting is lovely and the colors are nice and rich.  Great job!', '2007-05-04 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614083, 505918, 30508, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  The colors are strong and compelling and the composition is intriguing and works well with the challenge.  I''ll be curious to see how you achieved the effect.</td>', 'I like this very much.  The colors are strong and compelling and the composition is intriguing and works well with the challenge.  I''ll be curious to see how you achieved the effect.', '2007-05-04 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614084, 505992, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this...nice shot</td>', 'I like the composition of this...nice shot', '2007-05-04 09:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614090, 503498, 34938, '<td valign="top">very good...there is another one that has used an apple, but you get full marks for creativity in doing it like this</td>', 'very good...there is another one that has used an apple, but you get full marks for creativity in doing it like this', '2007-05-04 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614093, 505782, 75731, '<td valign="top">The only person I''ve seen that mentioned Pi being transcendental, awesome. I love the idea, the posts look sharp, I also like the toning. I do think that the white is a bit too much, If this were mine I would have cropped almost a third off the top and right of the image.</td>', 'The only person I''ve seen that mentioned Pi being transcendental, awesome. I love the idea, the posts look sharp, I also like the toning. I do think that the white is a bit too much, If this were mine I would have cropped almost a third off the top and right of the image.', '2007-05-04 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614100, 506055, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge.  It conures images of laurel wreaths on the heads of ancient greek philosophers.  Softer lighting might have enhanced the color and texture of the leaves, and a less modern looking wood background would also strengthen the theme.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge.  It conures images of laurel wreaths on the heads of ancient greek philosophers.  Softer lighting might have enhanced the color and texture of the leaves, and a less modern looking wood background would also strengthen the theme.', '2007-05-04 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614102, 505589, 34938, '<td valign="top">excellent...nice an warm image...8</td>', 'excellent...nice an warm image...8', '2007-05-04 09:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614106, 503522, 30508, '<td valign="top">Well lit and good, sharp focus.  I''m not sure about the tie in between the cards and the number pi besides the obvious numerical reference.  The circular chips are by far a stronger tie in with the callenge topic and would have been better if they played a larger role in the composition.  I do love the way you''ve captured the rich color and texture of the wood, though.</td>', 'Well lit and good, sharp focus.  I''m not sure about the tie in between the cards and the number pi besides the obvious numerical reference.  The circular chips are by far a stronger tie in with the callenge topic and would have been better if they played a larger role in the composition.  I do love the way you''ve captured the rich color and texture of the wood, though.', '2007-05-04 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614111, 505407, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice emphasis on details.  The intricate threading on the compass nicely mirrors the intricacy of the detailed definition.  The selective focus works well to guide the eye.  Might be stronger if the image displayed more to the right and less to the left since the definition on the left is in sharp focus and has nothing to do with pi.</td>', 'Nice emphasis on details.  The intricate threading on the compass nicely mirrors the intricacy of the detailed definition.  The selective focus works well to guide the eye.  Might be stronger if the image displayed more to the right and less to the left since the definition on the left is in sharp focus and has nothing to do with pi.', '2007-05-04 09:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614125, 502912, 30508, '<td valign="top">This looks like an experiment in shallow depth of field, but the composition doesn''t work well for it.  It seems like the goal was to have the begining of the number in sharp focus and then have it fade off out of focus as it continues, thus demonstrating the infinity of pi.  However, the table top, chair and the rest of the background distract from this.  It would be a stronger message if the all we saw was the white paper and numbers on it instead.</td>', 'This looks like an experiment in shallow depth of field, but the composition doesn''t work well for it.  It seems like the goal was to have the begining of the number in sharp focus and then have it fade off out of focus as it continues, thus demonstrating the infinity of pi.  However, the table top, chair and the rest of the background distract from this.  It would be a stronger message if the all we saw was the white paper and numbers on it instead.', '2007-05-04 10:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614161, 506183, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a very clever interpretation of the challenge.  The lace tablecloth gives this a real home-spun feel that works well with the yellowish lighting.  My only criticism would be that the lighting feels a little too hot, especially on the third pie from the left.</td>', 'This is a very clever interpretation of the challenge.  The lace tablecloth gives this a real home-spun feel that works well with the yellowish lighting.  My only criticism would be that the lighting feels a little too hot, especially on the third pie from the left.', '2007-05-04 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614217, 505905, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting approach, but the lighting really ruins what could have been a great shot.  It appears that you used straight-on lighting (such as an on-camera flash) and that resulted in very flat lighting, a poor shadow around the apple, and the hot spot in the middle.  The conversion to B&amp;W just emphasises the flatness of it.  Try lighting it from the left side or somewhere between the front and side.  The shadow could then become a graphical element of the image, and the roundess of it would work well with the pi theme.</td>', 'This is an interesting approach, but the lighting really ruins what could have been a great shot.  It appears that you used straight-on lighting (such as an on-camera flash) and that resulted in very flat lighting, a poor shadow around the apple, and the hot spot in the middle.  The conversion to B&W just emphasises the flatness of it.  Try lighting it from the left side or somewhere between the front and side.  The shadow could then become a graphical element of the image, and the roundess of it would work well with the pi theme.', '2007-05-04 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614451, 502873, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I''m not sure if I like the high contrast, but it is effective.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I''m not sure if I like the high contrast, but it is effective.', '2007-05-04 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614462, 505039, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  With a little more effort, I think this could have been very effective, but it''s missing some finesse, and the bubble is hard to see.  Overall, not bad.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  With a little more effort, I think this could have been very effective, but it''s missing some finesse, and the bubble is hard to see.  Overall, not bad.', '2007-05-04 11:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614464, 504731, 71958, '<td valign="top">this has a bit of an artifical feel to it, but it''s one of my two favorites in this challenge.  nicely done.</td>', 'this has a bit of an artifical feel to it, but it''s one of my two favorites in this challenge.  nicely done.', '2007-05-04 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614473, 505906, 39430, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see more variation in the lighting so the main cards stand out more, but a cool idea.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see more variation in the lighting so the main cards stand out more, but a cool idea.', '2007-05-04 11:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614479, 504465, 71958, '<td valign="top">very nice capture, but i do think it is a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'very nice capture, but i do think it is a stretch for the challenge.', '2007-05-04 11:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614480, 506183, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I really don''t like that table cloth.  :)</td>', 'Hmm, I really don''t like that table cloth.  :)', '2007-05-04 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614484, 505393, 71958, '<td valign="top">i really like this idea.  the light is a bit unbalanced, and there seems to be a bit too much grain, but nice composition.</td>', 'i really like this idea.  the light is a bit unbalanced, and there seems to be a bit too much grain, but nice composition.', '2007-05-04 11:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614487, 506090, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Would benefit from better lighting, making the note easier to see.  As it is, the colourful label on the bottle seems more the focus of this image.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Would benefit from better lighting, making the note easier to see.  As it is, the colourful label on the bottle seems more the focus of this image.', '2007-05-04 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614493, 506028, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect.  It''s a little hard to see what''s under there.  It''s trigonometry, which is related, but is there actually a PI under there</td>', 'Very cool effect.  It''s a little hard to see what''s under there.  It''s trigonometry, which is related, but is there actually a PI under there', '2007-05-04 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614504, 505814, 39430, '<td valign="top">The shadow is a little distracting, but it does add balance to the composition.  I''d prefer to see more of the pencil.  It looks like someone who''s been caught in the side of a photo, with a rabbit-in the headlights expression, because they didn''t bother to smile, because they thought they weren''t in the shot.  OK, maybe I''m overanalysing here.  :)</td>', 'The shadow is a little distracting, but it does add balance to the composition.  I''d prefer to see more of the pencil.  It looks like someone who''s been caught in the side of a photo, with a rabbit-in the headlights expression, because they didn''t bother to smile, because they thought they weren''t in the shot.  OK, maybe I''m overanalysing here.  :)', '2007-05-04 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614509, 504054, 39430, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s pi.  Very literal interpretation.  Maybe try to think more outside the square.  :)</td>', 'Yup, that''s pi.  Very literal interpretation.  Maybe try to think more outside the square.  :)', '2007-05-04 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614522, 505866, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice balance of objects.  The saturation is a little distracting.  Maybe would be better with some subdued false tones.  The light is also a little flat.  Try some diffused lighting off to one side, and not so bright.</td>', 'Nice balance of objects.  The saturation is a little distracting.  Maybe would be better with some subdued false tones.  The light is also a little flat.  Try some diffused lighting off to one side, and not so bright.', '2007-05-04 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614527, 504464, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice stars!  You could try a different crop, maybe chop off the RHS of the image with the light post.</td>', 'Nice stars!  You could try a different crop, maybe chop off the RHS of the image with the light post.', '2007-05-04 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614534, 506152, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like this.  You''ve used lighting really well.  The floor is a little dark, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and assume it''s my monitor.</td>', 'I like this.  You''ve used lighting really well.  The floor is a little dark, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and assume it''s my monitor.', '2007-05-04 11:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614548, 505342, 39430, '<td valign="top">I really like the ''drawing'' effect - even the pencil looks drawn.  The lighting is a little flat on the paper, and that contrasts with the ''snapshot'' lighting on the watch, but the overall result is nice.</td>', 'I really like the ''drawing'' effect - even the pencil looks drawn.  The lighting is a little flat on the paper, and that contrasts with the ''snapshot'' lighting on the watch, but the overall result is nice.', '2007-05-04 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614554, 505872, 39430, '<td valign="top">I think I can see a mistake!  Nice lighting, although it would look even better with more contrast.</td>', 'I think I can see a mistake!  Nice lighting, although it would look even better with more contrast.', '2007-05-04 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614560, 506109, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, stretching the challenge a little, but I just told someone else to think outside the box, so we can''t have everything.  The dark shadow is odd, particularly being right in the middle of the image.  It might have been better to take a few steps forward and either use the shadow to darken the fg, or get rid of it altogether.</td>', 'Hmm, stretching the challenge a little, but I just told someone else to think outside the box, so we can''t have everything.  The dark shadow is odd, particularly being right in the middle of the image.  It might have been better to take a few steps forward and either use the shadow to darken the fg, or get rid of it altogether.', '2007-05-04 11:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614562, 504953, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2007-05-04 11:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614569, 503498, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I only wish the background were solid, but it works well here.  Great idea and execution (you are so much more patient than I could ever be!)</td>', 'Very nice!  I only wish the background were solid, but it works well here.  Great idea and execution (you are so much more patient than I could ever be!)', '2007-05-04 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614577, 503032, 70514, '<td valign="top">How...?  Looks great, fun idea, nice execution, crisp and great contrast!</td>', 'How...?  Looks great, fun idea, nice execution, crisp and great contrast!', '2007-05-04 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614578, 505834, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, so far, Montecarlo says Pi = 4, cause there ain''t no spots on the tile.  Apart from that, this is a good image.  Nice lighting.  The biggest technical problem is colour bleeding, possibly from using chroma noise reduction?  An off-board flash should get this effect without having to push the ISO too high, and a lower ISO won''t need so much NR.  Focus is a little soft, probably from NR again.  Highlight on front of tile is also distracting.  Despite all this, it''s a nice image, and I''m scoring it well. :)</td>', 'Well, so far, Montecarlo says Pi = 4, cause there ain''t no spots on the tile.  Apart from that, this is a good image.  Nice lighting.  The biggest technical problem is colour bleeding, possibly from using chroma noise reduction?  An off-board flash should get this effect without having to push the ISO too high, and a lower ISO won''t need so much NR.  Focus is a little soft, probably from NR again.  Highlight on front of tile is also distracting.  Despite all this, it''s a nice image, and I''m scoring it well. :)', '2007-05-04 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614585, 505782, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  I don''t like the super-high-key processing though.  Might be improved with less sky in the crop.</td>', 'Nice find!  I don''t like the super-high-key processing though.  Might be improved with less sky in the crop.', '2007-05-04 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614589, 504860, 70514, '<td valign="top">UNFAIR how yummy that ice cream looks...</td>', 'UNFAIR how yummy that ice cream looks...', '2007-05-04 11:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614590, 505591, 39430, '<td valign="top">A bit more saturation and some sharpening would really bring this image up.  It would also help if he was looking intently at the camera, radiating power and a stronger connection with the viewer.  I like the toussled hair!</td>', 'A bit more saturation and some sharpening would really bring this image up.  It would also help if he was looking intently at the camera, radiating power and a stronger connection with the viewer.  I like the toussled hair!', '2007-05-04 11:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614596, 506055, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the colour of the wood really doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the colour of the wood really doesn''t work for me.', '2007-05-04 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614604, 506013, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the border on this - i think it would be better without.  It looks like there is white balance problems in the background, as the green leaves look a little blue and cold.</td>', 'I don''t like the border on this - i think it would be better without.  It looks like there is white balance problems in the background, as the green leaves look a little blue and cold.', '2007-05-04 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
