(3614624, 506090, 70514, '<td valign="top">Too good to pass up!</td>', 'Too good to pass up!', '2007-05-04 12:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614625, 506075, 39430, '<td valign="top">What is this?</td>', 'What is this?', '2007-05-04 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614627, 506141, 39430, '<td valign="top">I love his expression.  That''s how I feel sometimes when I''m working on something tricky.</td>', 'I love his expression.  That''s how I feel sometimes when I''m working on something tricky.', '2007-05-04 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614636, 502912, 39430, '<td valign="top">The DOF and the low angle make it hard to see what this actually is.  Be careful of your backgrouns - this background is not relevant to the shot, and is distracting.  Experiment more with different lighting.  Lamps are great because you can move them around and easily experiment with different lighting for a small scene.</td>', 'The DOF and the low angle make it hard to see what this actually is.  Be careful of your backgrouns - this background is not relevant to the shot, and is distracting.  Experiment more with different lighting.  Lamps are great because you can move them around and easily experiment with different lighting for a small scene.', '2007-05-04 12:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614640, 502811, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, like the colors.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, like the colors.', '2007-05-04 12:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614644, 504681, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I''d like to see more texture and contrast in the hand.  Perhaps the original shot did not have interesting lighting, and it still shows here.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I''d like to see more texture and contrast in the hand.  Perhaps the original shot did not have interesting lighting, and it still shows here.', '2007-05-04 12:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614651, 505918, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love abstracts, and this is no exception.</td>', 'I love abstracts, and this is no exception.', '2007-05-04 12:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614654, 505488, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  Overall, this image is pretty good, but would benefit from better composition.  Try recropping this photo to make use of the rule of 3rds - or maybe the rule or 3.14rds  :)  Yeah, OK, that wasn''t funny at all, but I''m a dad, so I can get away with it.</td>', 'Cool idea.  Overall, this image is pretty good, but would benefit from better composition.  Try recropping this photo to make use of the rule of 3rds - or maybe the rule or 3.14rds  :)  Yeah, OK, that wasn''t funny at all, but I''m a dad, so I can get away with it.', '2007-05-04 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614655, 504337, 39679, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with the challenge.', '2007-05-04 12:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614662, 505500, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-05-04 12:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614663, 504921, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get it.  Is it because there''s 3.14 of them in the shot?</td>', 'I''m not sure I get it.  Is it because there''s 3.14 of them in the shot?', '2007-05-04 12:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614666, 504860, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t wanna ask what the Pi is made of.  :)  Nice shot</td>', 'I don''t wanna ask what the Pi is made of.  :)  Nice shot', '2007-05-04 12:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614674, 504119, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this looks very familiar.  I think you two must know each other.</td>', 'Hmm, this looks very familiar.  I think you two must know each other.', '2007-05-04 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614681, 505787, 39430, '<td valign="top">The shadows say that your pi is falling off.  There''s a slight green tinge to the colour, which is bugging me, but overall quite good.</td>', 'The shadows say that your pi is falling off.  There''s a slight green tinge to the colour, which is bugging me, but overall quite good.', '2007-05-04 12:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614689, 505791, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but looks a little overprocessed with the contrast.</td>', 'Not bad, but looks a little overprocessed with the contrast.', '2007-05-04 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614693, 503580, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  The edges of the image seem a little unnecessary, so it might improve with tigher cropping.</td>', 'Not bad.  The edges of the image seem a little unnecessary, so it might improve with tigher cropping.', '2007-05-04 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614700, 505670, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I don''t get it.  What''s the focus of the image?  The composition might improve with closer cropping.  But at the end of the day, I just don''t get it.</td>', 'Hmm, I don''t get it.  What''s the focus of the image?  The composition might improve with closer cropping.  But at the end of the day, I just don''t get it.', '2007-05-04 12:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614706, 505393, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I think the lighting lets this image down though.  With more inventive lighting, and correct white balance, this could be a winner.  This also looks a little overprocessed with the contrast and sharpening.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I think the lighting lets this image down though.  With more inventive lighting, and correct white balance, this could be a winner.  This also looks a little overprocessed with the contrast and sharpening.', '2007-05-04 12:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614710, 506042, 39430, '<td valign="top">Actually, there''s no soup.  Did you eat it all?  I had to look hard to see the relevance of this image to the challenge.  Maybe a bit too subtle?</td>', 'Actually, there''s no soup.  Did you eat it all?  I had to look hard to see the relevance of this image to the challenge.  Maybe a bit too subtle?', '2007-05-04 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614729, 506093, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ah, the woodies always get a look in somewhere.  This looks painful.  The shadows are rather odd.  I''d feel more at home if that light was moved above the level of the woodies.</td>', 'Ah, the woodies always get a look in somewhere.  This looks painful.  The shadows are rather odd.  I''d feel more at home if that light was moved above the level of the woodies.', '2007-05-04 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614731, 506100, 39430, '<td valign="top">DNMC.  Sorry.</td>', 'DNMC.  Sorry.', '2007-05-04 12:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614736, 505499, 39430, '<td valign="top">Now, that is really cool.  How did you get the images in focus?  Yep, there''s nothing not to like about this image.</td>', 'Now, that is really cool.  How did you get the images in focus?  Yep, there''s nothing not to like about this image.', '2007-05-04 12:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614740, 506194, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is kind of like PI on holidays.  :)  It''s a wierdly forced link to the challenge, but that''s OK.  Nice colours and composition</td>', 'This is kind of like PI on holidays.  :)  It''s a wierdly forced link to the challenge, but that''s OK.  Nice colours and composition', '2007-05-04 12:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614746, 505953, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see the focus point slightly further back.  Or maybe with the line coming toward the focus.  As it is, the past is in focus, and the eye keeps being drawn along the line to the pen which is out of focus, which is disconcerting.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see the focus point slightly further back.  Or maybe with the line coming toward the focus.  As it is, the past is in focus, and the eye keeps being drawn along the line to the pen which is out of focus, which is disconcerting.', '2007-05-04 12:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614764, 504465, 39430, '<td valign="top">Similar concept to another shot, but I like this one much better.  Great composition, and the people add a nice point of contact for the viewer.</td>', 'Similar concept to another shot, but I like this one much better.  Great composition, and the people add a nice point of contact for the viewer.', '2007-05-04 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614834, 506195, 56254, '<td valign="top">bright spot on the bottom and harsh shadows hurt this one a bit ... also a bit too centered for my liking ... good color saturation though</td>', 'bright spot on the bottom and harsh shadows hurt this one a bit ... also a bit too centered for my liking ... good color saturation though', '2007-05-04 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614836, 503522, 56254, '<td valign="top">digital jaggies hurt this one ... composition is a bit too centered also</td>', 'digital jaggies hurt this one ... composition is a bit too centered also', '2007-05-04 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614842, 505875, 25036, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a little more crisp</td>', 'Needs to be a little more crisp', '2007-05-04 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614851, 505918, 25036, '<td valign="top">Fractal Perhaps</td>', 'Fractal Perhaps', '2007-05-04 13:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614864, 505782, 75323, '<td valign="top">Like the mood of this shot, simplicity and infinity at same time. The sepia tone also works well.</td>', 'Like the mood of this shot, simplicity and infinity at same time. The sepia tone also works well.', '2007-05-04 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614869, 502912, 75323, '<td valign="top">The idea could have make it but... There''s some disturbing points: the background isn''t simple enought to keep the eye on the subject, and in my opinion the fonts of the number are too big or you are too close, and the lighting could have been used, too.</td>', 'The idea could have make it but... There''s some disturbing points: the background isn''t simple enought to keep the eye on the subject, and in my opinion the fonts of the number are too big or you are too close, and the lighting could have been used, too.', '2007-05-04 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614870, 505109, 75323, '<td valign="top">Simple... But why not. Interesting effect.</td>', 'Simple... But why not. Interesting effect.', '2007-05-04 13:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614871, 503486, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I know binary, but I don''t see pi there.  I would have tried to make more of the flowers in focus, but let them get out of focus as it trails back, symbolizing the infinite progression of pi.</td>', 'Hmmm...I know binary, but I don''t see pi there.  I would have tried to make more of the flowers in focus, but let them get out of focus as it trails back, symbolizing the infinite progression of pi.', '2007-05-04 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614872, 506090, 75323, '<td valign="top">I really love how the title perfectly completes the shot !</td>', 'I really love how the title perfectly completes the shot !', '2007-05-04 13:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614878, 505393, 75323, '<td valign="top">Haha, well found !</td>', 'Haha, well found !', '2007-05-04 13:27:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3615023, 506129, 38930, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...probably no need to describe how you took it in the title tho.  That''s what the description field is for ;-)</td>', 'Cool shot...probably no need to describe how you took it in the title tho.  That''s what the description field is for ;-)', '2007-05-04 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615034, 505407, 38930, '<td valign="top">Not too fond of the hole in the center, but nice shot anyways!</td>', 'Not too fond of the hole in the center, but nice shot anyways!', '2007-05-04 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615049, 504731, 38930, '<td valign="top">Blue ribbon right here</td>', 'Blue ribbon right here', '2007-05-04 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615061, 505866, 30508, '<td valign="top">The composition is interesting and fairly well executed.  The lighting seems a little hard, though.  As far as impact, this seems to just scratch the surface of pi and doesn''t offer any further depth.  But, there does seem to be a story here, perhaps of a grade school student working on their geometry homework.</td>', 'The composition is interesting and fairly well executed.  The lighting seems a little hard, though.  As far as impact, this seems to just scratch the surface of pi and doesn''t offer any further depth.  But, there does seem to be a story here, perhaps of a grade school student working on their geometry homework.', '2007-05-04 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615072, 506069, 30508, '<td valign="top">A very compelling and dramatic image.  It seems to be a study of the impact of the cold, hard numbers on the individual psyche (or maybe I''m just bs''ing myself ;)  This is strong, though, and I like it.  Nice work.</td>', 'A very compelling and dramatic image.  It seems to be a study of the impact of the cold, hard numbers on the individual psyche (or maybe I''m just bs''ing myself ;)  This is strong, though, and I like it.  Nice work.', '2007-05-04 14:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615187, 505562, 30508, '<td valign="top">This has a light, airy quality that I like.  Nice colors and interesting shapes.</td>', 'This has a light, airy quality that I like.  Nice colors and interesting shapes.', '2007-05-04 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615190, 505981, 30508, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and creatively done.</td>', 'Neat idea and creatively done.', '2007-05-04 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615285, 505488, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I really like the composition and the layout but if the focus was just a tad bit clearer in the magnifying glass then this would be about perfect.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I really like the composition and the layout but if the focus was just a tad bit clearer in the magnifying glass then this would be about perfect.', '2007-05-04 15:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615286, 506197, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The lighting is really nice as well.</td>', 'Great photo.  The lighting is really nice as well.', '2007-05-04 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615290, 505751, 77250, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure that I get it.</td>', 'I''m not really sure that I get it.', '2007-05-04 15:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615293, 505782, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2007-05-04 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615294, 505499, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections.  I love the multiple imagery of pi.  Well done.  9.</td>', 'Nice reflections.  I love the multiple imagery of pi.  Well done.  9.', '2007-05-04 15:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615298, 506140, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2007-05-04 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615300, 505953, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great composition but I think the tones could have been just a little more pleasing.</td>', 'Great composition but I think the tones could have been just a little more pleasing.', '2007-05-04 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615301, 505836, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation.  The watch idea is really great.</td>', 'Great interpretation.  The watch idea is really great.', '2007-05-04 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615310, 505905, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the tones could have just a little more contrast and the scene a little brighter for a better composition.</td>', 'Great idea but the tones could have just a little more contrast and the scene a little brighter for a better composition.', '2007-05-04 15:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615312, 505589, 77250, '<td valign="top">Great photo, well seen.</td>', 'Great photo, well seen.', '2007-05-04 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615318, 506130, 77250, '<td valign="top">Not completely sure about this interpretation.  Its a good photo but without the title nobody would think of "pi".</td>', 'Not completely sure about this interpretation.  Its a good photo but without the title nobody would think of "pi".', '2007-05-04 15:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615326, 506013, 77250, '<td valign="top">Was this done with a cutout piece of paper or with post processing?</td>', 'Was this done with a cutout piece of paper or with post processing?', '2007-05-04 15:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615335, 505856, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.  It must have taken some effort to create this.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.  It must have taken some effort to create this.', '2007-05-04 15:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615343, 505354, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but the focus could be just a little bit crisper.</td>', 'Nice photo but the focus could be just a little bit crisper.', '2007-05-04 15:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615357, 506184, 77250, '<td valign="top">I think that this is the best "graphic style" pi interpretation.  Well done.  You kept it simple and graphic while presenting a pleasing composition.</td>', 'I think that this is the best "graphic style" pi interpretation.  Well done.  You kept it simple and graphic while presenting a pleasing composition.', '2007-05-04 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615472, 506030, 68256, '<td valign="top">That is one wild eye!  I don''t know how you got such a perfect pi in the eye....7</td>', 'That is one wild eye!  I don''t know how you got such a perfect pi in the eye....7', '2007-05-04 16:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615490, 503981, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is probably the most clever shoehorn title and photo I''ve ever seen!  7 (mostly for effort although I do like the photo too!).</td>', 'Wow, that is probably the most clever shoehorn title and photo I''ve ever seen!  7 (mostly for effort although I do like the photo too!).', '2007-05-04 16:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615526, 506069, 73929, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better for me without the person... 9 for me!  :)</td>', 'This would have worked better for me without the person... 9 for me!  :)', '2007-05-04 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615529, 506184, 73929, '<td valign="top">This is a great setup!  A 9 for me!  :)</td>', 'This is a great setup!  A 9 for me!  :)', '2007-05-04 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615560, 505963, 37524, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2007-05-04 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615822, 505782, 54212, '<td valign="top">to much blow out for me.</td>', 'to much blow out for me.', '2007-05-04 18:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615828, 502873, 54212, '<td valign="top">appears blown out to me</td>', 'appears blown out to me', '2007-05-04 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615835, 505589, 54212, '<td valign="top">to much sky for me</td>', 'to much sky for me', '2007-05-04 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
