(3615859, 505814, 54212, '<td valign="top">appears to me to be blown out at the top</td>', 'appears to me to be blown out at the top', '2007-05-04 18:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3615862, 504337, 54212, '<td valign="top">How are the little honkers to get to the water?</td>', 'How are the little honkers to get to the water?', '2007-05-04 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616136, 506141, 54431, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, very creative! I love his expression!</td>', 'Nice idea, very creative! I love his expression!', '2007-05-04 20:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616706, 506075, 59198, '<td valign="top">the concept is a 10<br/>if you could edit with dodge and burn you could pop the contrast up a lot: 8<br/>Great composition:10<br/>I had to look at this twice to get the full effect:6<br/>The title helped a lot: 10<br/>Total: 8.8(low 9)<br/>I bet people won''t like it, which is a shame.<br/>I find this to be a well thought thru pic and you should be commended on that.<br/>GOOD JOB!!!</td>', 'the concept is a 10if you could edit with dodge and burn you could pop the contrast up a lot: 8Great composition:10I had to look at this twice to get the full effect:6The title helped a lot: 10Total: 8.8(low 9)I bet people won''t like it, which is a shame.I find this to be a well thought thru pic and you should be commended on that.GOOD JOB!!!', '2007-05-04 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616710, 503913, 59198, '<td valign="top">this would have been awesome if it where just a little sharper...still good though</td>', 'this would have been awesome if it where just a little sharper...still good though', '2007-05-04 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616714, 505499, 59198, '<td valign="top">NOW THAT IS AWESOME!!!!!!!!!<br/>That is perfect...good luck!!!!</td>', 'NOW THAT IS AWESOME!!!!!!!!!That is perfect...good luck!!!!', '2007-05-04 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616725, 504731, 59198, '<td valign="top">Great!!! I can''t wait to see who''s this is...</td>', 'Great!!! I can''t wait to see who''s this is...', '2007-05-04 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616730, 503498, 59198, '<td valign="top">This is how you do APPLE PI!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>Great way of getting this idea a cross!!!!!</td>', 'This is how you do APPLE PI!!!!!!! Great way of getting this idea a cross!!!!!', '2007-05-04 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617273, 505589, 4517, '<td valign="top">At last a good photo. Hope you win. 10</td>', 'At last a good photo. Hope you win. 10', '2007-05-05 05:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617274, 504731, 4517, '<td valign="top">My 2nd favorite of the challenge.9</td>', 'My 2nd favorite of the challenge.9', '2007-05-05 05:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617276, 503606, 4517, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones. 8</td>', 'One of the better ones. 8', '2007-05-05 05:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617430, 505782, 47852, '<td valign="top">Like the high key treatment here, I think it works nicely.  I also like how you kept the top cross pieces just above the horizon line.  If there is anything I might change, I think it would be the coloring... the reddish-brown makes it look like muddy water to me.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Like the high key treatment here, I think it works nicely.  I also like how you kept the top cross pieces just above the horizon line.  If there is anything I might change, I think it would be the coloring... the reddish-brown makes it look like muddy water to me.  Nicely done!', '2007-05-05 08:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617431, 505856, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice carving of the pi(e)!  For me, this one would be a much higher score if there had been as much attention to cleaning up the pie plate and wrinkled background as their was to the great pie cutting.  I can picture the pie moved to a clean plate, set on a smooth background, with a soft light placed off to the side.</td>', 'Nice carving of the pi(e)!  For me, this one would be a much higher score if there had been as much attention to cleaning up the pie plate and wrinkled background as their was to the great pie cutting.  I can picture the pie moved to a clean plate, set on a smooth background, with a soft light placed off to the side.', '2007-05-05 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617434, 503223, 47852, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to find the pi... it gets lost a bit in the shadows.  I like how it repeats though in the next layer back.</td>', 'Took me a second to find the pi... it gets lost a bit in the shadows.  I like how it repeats though in the next layer back.', '2007-05-05 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617437, 506197, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a perfect spot for the challenge!  Were you the one who suggested this one? ;)  It looks as though you tried to hide a sign behind the statue, but it''s still sticking out a bit.  The shot could use just a bit of a clockwise rotation too to level up the horizon.  Nice use of the rule of thirds for such a simple shot.</td>', 'What a perfect spot for the challenge!  Were you the one who suggested this one? ;)  It looks as though you tried to hide a sign behind the statue, but it''s still sticking out a bit.  The shot could use just a bit of a clockwise rotation too to level up the horizon.  Nice use of the rule of thirds for such a simple shot.', '2007-05-05 08:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617443, 506075, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ok, took me a while to make the connection to pi... the title was helpful, but I think the III:XIV is a bit too small and blends in too much to be easily seen.  You''ll probably get a few DNMC comments or votes from folks who don''t take the time.  I like the variety of circles and flow of the water line which moves your eye around, but the lighting seems a bit dull for this one.  Good luck!</td>', 'Ok, took me a while to make the connection to pi... the title was helpful, but I think the III:XIV is a bit too small and blends in too much to be easily seen.  You''ll probably get a few DNMC comments or votes from folks who don''t take the time.  I like the variety of circles and flow of the water line which moves your eye around, but the lighting seems a bit dull for this one.  Good luck!', '2007-05-05 08:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617445, 506184, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice simple setup and well done.  It''s hard to find the breaks in the numbers after the decimal... is it 3.1415 or 3.2549?  I''m glad I don''t have to write like this!</td>', 'Nice simple setup and well done.  It''s hard to find the breaks in the numbers after the decimal... is it 3.1415 or 3.2549?  I''m glad I don''t have to write like this!', '2007-05-05 08:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3617450, 505905, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice pi... not sure about the b/w choice here... makes the apple look very unappealing to me.</td>', 'Nice pi... not sure about the b/w choice here... makes the apple look very unappealing to me.', '2007-05-05 08:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
