(3625172, 504419, 52026, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and execution.  The only change I would have made was to orient it such that the 3.14 was at the top of the ring, where the current numbers are upside down.  Although then you would have to flip it so it was right side up.  My spatial thinking skills aren''t that great so maybe that isn''t even possible!</td>', 'Nice concept and execution.  The only change I would have made was to orient it such that the 3.14 was at the top of the ring, where the current numbers are upside down.  Although then you would have to flip it so it was right side up.  My spatial thinking skills aren''t that great so maybe that isn''t even possible!', '2007-05-07 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
