(3627192, 504465, 74371, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot! I really like it. <br/> <br/>I especially like the fact that the gentleman with the dog seems to be pointing to where 3.14159265358... would be on a clock face.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot! I really like it.  I especially like the fact that the gentleman with the dog seems to be pointing to where 3.14159265358... would be on a clock face.', '2007-05-08 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
