(3627299, 506130, 74371, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... and this picture relates to Pi ....how?  The picture itself is a grand one. I love silhouette shots, but I don''t understand why it is here. Sorry. (5)</td>', 'Hmmm... and this picture relates to Pi ....how?  The picture itself is a grand one. I love silhouette shots, but I don''t understand why it is here. Sorry. (5)', '2007-05-08 01:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
