(3628938, 505500, 69839, '<td valign="top">love the colors.</td>', 'love the colors.', '2007-05-08 14:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3628951, 506075, 61651, '<td valign="top">Clever, and took me a couple times viewing before I noticed it was a clock perched there.  Still don''t know quite what I''m looking at, but the circles, the clock time and the surreality of what appears to be a wall clock hanging in a sewer makes for an intriguing image and creative take on the challenge.  Good job!</td>', 'Clever, and took me a couple times viewing before I noticed it was a clock perched there.  Still don''t know quite what I''m looking at, but the circles, the clock time and the surreality of what appears to be a wall clock hanging in a sewer makes for an intriguing image and creative take on the challenge.  Good job!', '2007-05-08 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3629225, 503522, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the composition is fine, if a little pedestrian; the focus is sharp, but what damages this for me is the uneven exposure and flash highlight on the table.  I feel that the photograph would have benefitted from being cropped in closer, perhaps with a tighter arrangement of the cards.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the composition is fine, if a little pedestrian; the focus is sharp, but what damages this for me is the uneven exposure and flash highlight on the table.  I feel that the photograph would have benefitted from being cropped in closer, perhaps with a tighter arrangement of the cards.', '2007-05-08 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3629236, 506075, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly interesting, although, for this viewer, not entirely aethetically pleasing!  This appears to be the inside of some sort of drainage system, with a clock face placed in one of the drain-pipes.  I getthe relationship of the circles to pi, and to the significance of the time, but am unsure if I am missing something else.  One observation, and I think it is this that I find so interesting - there is something peculiarly organically female about the composition.  Strange!</td>', 'Certainly interesting, although, for this viewer, not entirely aethetically pleasing!  This appears to be the inside of some sort of drainage system, with a clock face placed in one of the drain-pipes.  I getthe relationship of the circles to pi, and to the significance of the time, but am unsure if I am missing something else.  One observation, and I think it is this that I find so interesting - there is something peculiarly organically female about the composition.  Strange!', '2007-05-08 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3629240, 506107, 67258, '<td valign="top">Clever idea - was the card actually on fire?  If so, hope you didn''t get burned - I imagine that nylon thread would have burned through quite quickly.</td>', 'Clever idea - was the card actually on fire?  If so, hope you didn''t get burned - I imagine that nylon thread would have burned through quite quickly.', '2007-05-08 16:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3629243, 506183, 67258, '<td valign="top">Come on, you didn''t get your protractor out, did you?!!  That aside, I like the idea, but wish you had stopped down you exposure by a couple of stops.</td>', 'Come on, you didn''t get your protractor out, did you?!!  That aside, I like the idea, but wish you had stopped down you exposure by a couple of stops.', '2007-05-08 16:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3629248, 506140, 67258, '<td valign="top">Clever, witty, well photographed, and well presented.  Good work.</td>', 'Clever, witty, well photographed, and well presented.  Good work.', '2007-05-08 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
