(3631414, 503606, 75323, '<td valign="top">Well ok, a bit disappointed as I really hoped to hit top 10... But that''s still cool to see how much good votes I got and so nice comments during voting.<br/> <br/>In order to answer :<br/> <br/>-I was very surprised to see people disturbed by the upside down book... Actually it''s just because I wanted the cube picture to be on the shot, and it was on the left page. And the only solution to make a left page appear on a right side is........ ? :-)<br/> <br/>-To all those who are talking about feelings and atmosphere, thanks twice ! That was the main goal of this shot.<br/> <br/>-About cropping a bit more on right side, I tried... And still prefer this version. I don''t really like too squared compositions.<br/> <br/>-To every commenter, thanks a lot ! I really enjoyed reading this all and seeing that great photographers could like my beginner work :-)</td>', 'Well ok, a bit disappointed as I really hoped to hit top 10... But that''s still cool to see how much good votes I got and so nice comments during voting. In order to answer : -I was very surprised to see people disturbed by the upside down book... Actually it''s just because I wanted the cube picture to be on the shot, and it was on the left page. And the only solution to make a left page appear on a right side is........ ? :-) -To all those who are talking about feelings and atmosphere, thanks twice ! That was the main goal of this shot. -About cropping a bit more on right side, I tried... And still prefer this version. I don''t really like too squared compositions. -To every commenter, thanks a lot ! I really enjoyed reading this all and seeing that great photographers could like my beginner work :-)', '2007-05-09 02:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631471, 505589, 67258, '<td valign="top">Long overdue - Conratulations on the Blue!</td>', 'Long overdue - Conratulations on the Blue!', '2007-05-09 02:37:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631517, 506137, 71657, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and the votes.  This is my first Pi entry, so I didn''t really know what to expect.  I can''t believe I didn''t palce in the last 20, though.  I am an amateur, and I hit this site to get some critiscm and feedback so I can improve and hopefully place up there within the top 10 eventually.  So, any comments and feedback is welcomed.  Thank you.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and the votes.  This is my first Pi entry, so I didn''t really know what to expect.  I can''t believe I didn''t palce in the last 20, though.  I am an amateur, and I hit this site to get some critiscm and feedback so I can improve and hopefully place up there within the top 10 eventually.  So, any comments and feedback is welcomed.  Thank you.', '2007-05-09 02:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
