(3631656, 505589, 47541, '<td valign="top">Blue blue blue - woo hoo!  Congrats on the blue ... and this one shows up on your front page (if you have enough images showing). Congratulations teammate!<br/> <br/>So...both your ribbons are from trips away from home.  You should sell the house, by a house-bus and hit the road.  It''s the only way to ensure you get more ribbons you know ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-09 03:52:19.</i></td>', 'Blue blue blue - woo hoo!  Congrats on the blue ... and this one shows up on your front page (if you have enough images showing). Congratulations teammate! So...both your ribbons are from trips away from home.  You should sell the house, by a house-bus and hit the road.  It''s the only way to ensure you get more ribbons you know ;)', '2007-05-09 04:12:53.000000', '2007-05-09 04:52:19.000000', 0),
