(3631679, 505500, 71121, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites - and people complain about "not meeting the challenge", "except the circle"... WTF?<br/> <br/>Simply put, Pi is the conversion factor from a circle diameter to its circumference. *Pi* is ALL about circles, much more so than it is about the greek symbol "pi". <br/> <br/>Looking at the photos in this "pi" challenge, it''s like you have a challenge "apple" and people start shooting the word apple instead of real apples. Or perhaps the number "5" since it has five letters. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work, the other voters just didn''t get it. <br/></td>', 'This is one of my favourites - and people complain about "not meeting the challenge", "except the circle"... WTF? Simply put, Pi is the conversion factor from a circle diameter to its circumference. *Pi* is ALL about circles, much more so than it is about the greek symbol "pi".  Looking at the photos in this "pi" challenge, it''s like you have a challenge "apple" and people start shooting the word apple instead of real apples. Or perhaps the number "5" since it has five letters.  Keep up the good work, the other voters just didn''t get it. ', '2007-05-09 04:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
