(3637164, 506134, 76153, '<td valign="top">yeah, we saw the circles; the reason that it doesnt meet challenge is that pi is not JUST about circles. Going out and taking a picture of just any old circle isnt going to garner any sort of praise. I would have given a photograph involving ANY actual math a higher score than this.</td>', 'yeah, we saw the circles; the reason that it doesnt meet challenge is that pi is not JUST about circles. Going out and taking a picture of just any old circle isnt going to garner any sort of praise. I would have given a photograph involving ANY actual math a higher score than this.', '2007-05-10 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 0),
